    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33768" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλκ-υστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ductile</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥύσιον</span>
